{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "HUMAN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THIS IS YOUR FINAL\nAND MOST DANGEROUS\nCHALLENGE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BEHOLD!\nTHE GAUNTLET OF\nDEADLY TERROR!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "text": "WHEN I SAY THE\nWORD, IT WILL\nFULLY ACTIVATE!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "CANNONS WILL FIRE!\nSPIKES WILL SWING!\nBLADES WILL SLICE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "EACH PART WILL\nSWING VIOLENTLY\nUP AND DOWN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ONLY THE TINIEST\nCHANCE OF VICTORY\nWILL REMAIN!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ARE YOU READY!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BECAUSE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AM!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ABOUT!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "TO DO IT!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "pause": [
    {
      "text": "* well?\n* what's the holdup?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "HOLDUP!?\nWHAT HOLDUP!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'M...\nI'M ABOUT TO\nACTIVATE IT NOW!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "cancel": [
    {
      "text": "* that, uh, doesn't look\n  very activated.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "WELL!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THIS CHALLENGE!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT SEEMS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MAYBE... TOO EASY\nTO DEFEAT THE\nHUMAN WITH.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YEAH!\nWE CAN'T USE\nTHIS ONE!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I AM A SKELETON\nWITH STANDARDS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MY PUZZLES ARE\nVERY FAIR!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND MY TRAPS ARE\nEXPERTLY COOKED!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BUT THIS METHOD\nIS TOO DIRECT!\nNO CLASS AT ALL!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AWAY IT GOES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "cancelMurder": [
    {
      "text": "* that, uh, doesn't look\n  very activated.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "WELL!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "... THEY'RE PROBABLY\nGOING TO WALK\nTHROUGH IT.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND IT WON'T BE\nANY FUN AT ALL.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* hmmm...\n* so this human thing\n  was a bust, huh?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "WELL. I MEAN.\nI'M EXCITED TO\nCAPTURE THEM.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SO I'LL BECOME\nA FAMOUS ROYAL\nGUARDSMAN!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BUT ALL THE TIME\nI PUT INTO THESE\nPUZZLES...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT'S KIND OF LIKE\nTHROWING A\nBIRTHDAY PARTY...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* without traps and fire?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "EXACTLY!!\nIT'S POINTLESS!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusevil",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MAYBE YOU WERE\nRIGHT TO BE LAZY\nABOUT PUZZLES.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* me?\n* right about something?\n* really?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YEAH!!\nWHAT AM I SAYING!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU'RE STILL\nCOMPLETELY WRONG!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I JUST HAVE THE\nWRONG AUDIENCE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THINK ABOUT HOW\nMUCH FUN UNDYNE\nWOULD HAVE HERE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "FLAMES, VIOLENCE.\nIT'S RIGHT UP HER\nALLEY!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SO I WON'T WASTE\nTHIS PUZZLE ON\nYOU.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I JUST HAVE TO\nAPPRECIATE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE FRIEND I\nALREADY HAVE!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "bye": [
    {
      "text": "PHEW!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "last": [
    {
      "text": "WHAT ARE YOU\nLOOKING AT!?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THIS WAS ANOTHER\nDECISIVE VICTORY\nFOR PAPYRUS!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NYEH!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEH!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HEH???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "lastMurder": [
    {
      "text": "A VALUABLE LIFE\nLESSON!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NYEH HEH HEH!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "sans": [
    {
      "text": "* i don't know what my\n  brother's going to do\n  now.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* if i were you, i would\n  make sure i understand\n  blue attacks.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "sansMemory": [
    {
      "text": "* here, i'll give you some\n  advice about fighting\n  my brother.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* don't.\n* capiche?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "sansMurder": [
    {
      "text": "* hmmm...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* guess we didn't need\n  your help to have a\n  good time after all.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansblink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* say, i've been\n  thinking.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* seems like you're\n  gonna fight my brother\n  pretty soon.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* here's some friendly\n  advice.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* if you keep going the\n  way you are now...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansblink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansblink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* you're gonna have a\n  bad time.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sansnoeyes",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "camera": [
    {
      "text": "* ...!?\n* There is a camera behind the...\n  \"sentry station.\"",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
